75
00:04:01,410 --> 00:04:06,010
where the amount of compute
used in training smaller models,

76
00:04:06,010 --> 00:04:07,890
if you could increase
the amount of data,

77
00:04:07,890 --> 00:04:11,388
has been shown to help
improve certain benchmarks.

78
00:04:11,388 --> 00:04:12,930
And then the third
point is that when

79
00:04:12,930 --> 00:04:15,050
you're doing reinforcement
learning, as opposed

80
00:04:15,050 --> 00:04:17,410
to supervised learning, you
