235
00:11:03,930 --> 00:11:06,550
So certain domains
benefit way more

236
00:11:06,550 --> 00:11:10,110
from this train time
scaling kind of techniques

237
00:11:10,110 --> 00:11:13,070
as opposed to if you look at
